<ptxt>
ABS and/or ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> warning light does not turn ON after setting ignition “ON”
</ptxt>
</condition>
<ps>
<ptxt>
Malfunctioning ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> function
</ptxt>
</ps>
<action>
<ptxt>
